This distribution includes modified native inference architecture code derived
from Kokoro and StyleTTS2. AkinVox's release is independent of the upstream projects.

Kokoro: https://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro
Kokoro-82M: https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M (Apache-2.0)
StyleTTS2: https://github.com/yl4579/StyleTTS2
Copyright (c) 2023 Aaron (Yinghao) Li. MIT License.
The original MIT notice is retained in licenses/StyleTTS2-MIT.txt.

Local modifications include shared stock language-adapter selection, native model
reconstruction, phoneme validation, finalized multispeaker conditioning and public
Python/command-line interfaces. Dependencies retain their own licenses.
No eSpeak-NG binary/data, dependency source or training recordings are bundled.
